[APPROVED
LBY AJessandra at 9:03 am, Apr 28, 2021J
RESOLUTION NO.
ENTITLED: “A
RESOLUTION
RESCINDING
RESOLUTION
NO.
6023
WHICH
ESTABLISHES THAT ALL REVENUE FROM CITY CONTRACT NO.
5902 TO BE SPLIT EVENLY BETWEEN THE CITY OF CHEYENNE
SOLID
WASTE
ENTERPRISE
FUND,
THE
BOARD
OF
PUBLIC
UTILITIES,
AND
THE
NEWLY ESTABLISHED
BELVOIR RANCH
RECREATION SPECIAL REVENUE FUND.”
WHEREAS, the City of Cheyenne established the distribution of revenue from City
Contract No. 5902, in Resolution No. 6023, effective November 25, 2019; and
WHEREAS, it has been determined that this revenue would be better utilized by the
General Fund; and
WHEREAS, that Resolution No. 6023 is hereby rescinded and all revenue from City
Contract No. 5902 shall go to the General Fund.
NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE
CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING, that Resolution No. 6023 is hereby rescinded and all
revenue from City Contract No. 5902 shall go to the General Fund.
PRESENTED, READ AND ADOPTED this
_____
day of_
2021.
CITY OF CHEYENNE
BY:
Patrick Collins, Mayor
(SEAL)
ATTEST:
Kristina F. Jones, City Clerk
